    coolkey: Do not interpret empty answers as success

    Thanks to oss-fuzz

    https://bugs.chromium.org/p/oss-fuzz/issues/detail?id=18868

diff --git a/src/libopensc/card-coolkey.c b/src/libopensc/card-coolkey.c
